*.pid
push*.err
push*.log
world-engine-godot/build-godot.pid
world-engine-godot/build-godot.err

# Godot .NET build output (Godot.NET.Sdk emits under .godot/mono/, but keep
# bin/obj ignored in case the SDK layout changes or a plain dotnet build is run)
world-engine-godot/**/bin/
world-engine-godot/**/obj/

# --- Epic Fab source assets: NOT redistributable ---
# Fab Standard License (https://www.fab.com/eula) permits using the assets in any
# tool, modifying them, and shipping a built Project that incorporates them. It
# does NOT permit distributing the Content on a standalone basis; sharing with
# collaborators is limited to a PRIVATE repository (EULA sec.5a).
#
# This repo is PUBLIC, so Fab source must never be tracked in it. See
# world-engine-godot/ASSET-MANIFEST.md for the full provenance record.
#
# KNOWN LIMIT: gitignore has no effect on already-tracked files. ~745 files
# (~804 MB) under the paths below are still tracked from commit f3cc818
# (2026-09-25) and will keep being committed until someone runs
# `git rm -r --cached` on them. History rewrite was considered and declined
# 2026-10-03; the past exposure is recorded, not remediated.

# Fab packs in Unreal native format.
WorldEngine/Content/Fab/

# Fab-derived city grid textures (seaworn_*, roofingtiles*, tree_*, zzaple*).
WorldEngine/Content/City/Grid/CityGridTextured/

# Staged imports: GLB splits, source FBX, TGA textures, split helper scripts.
WorldEngine/Imports/FabCity/

# Godot-side copies of the same art, staged for local scene building.
world-engine-godot/assets/props/
world-engine-godot/assets/props-cc0/

# --- Build output and local scratch (never source) -------------------------
# dotnet build/obj output for the Godot .NET assembly and the out-of-engine harness.
world-engine-godot/AgentLoopEndpoint/obj/
world-engine-godot/AgentLoopEndpoint/bin/

# Compiled GDExtension probe outputs (nlt.windows.template_debug.*).
world-engine-godot/project/bin/

# Local tooling/scratch: agent settings, captured screenshots, editor templates,
# and one-off imported sample assets.
world-engine-godot/.poolside/
world-engine-godot/screenshots/
world-engine-godot/script_templates/
world-engine-godot/sample map/
